        "id": 1000056
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-05-03T17:24:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sure, that can be done.\n\n\nIf you look at update_child_devices_state() method in adapter_agent, it ahows a way to go from a parent device to a child device.  We can create a generic method for this.",
      "parentUuid": "ba092121_500c8242",
      "revId": "f5101822e019b0abeba0bdbee099cca49f4f3898",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
      "unresolved": false
